<title>USA: ImmuDyne names president/COO.</title>
<headline>ImmuDyne names president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>ImmuDyne said Wednesday that L. Melvin Cooper had been promoted to the posts of president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>He will work closely with James Wood, chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>ImmuDyne said this will facilitate a smooth transition of responsibilities to maximize the growth opportunities of the company, as Wood prepares to retire in December 1997.</p>
<p>Wood plans to assist and advise ImmuDyne, thereafter, on a consulting basis, the company said.</p>
<p>In addition to his duties as president and COO, Cooper will temporarily continue in the role of chief financial officer, the company said.</p>
</text>
